commit 4c93a1541e8fd120dbf2e60159b722397310d04f

C03: deterministic brightness readers (BRIGHT1283 repair)

effect_intent: brightness_status_request → system.settings.status; _literal_brightness_adjustment → system.settings.adjust with the authored amount and direction; brightness_relative_without_amount → ClarificationIntent(system.settings.adjust, amount) keeping the direction (owner rule H0027; «un toque»/«un poco» also ask); absolute levels and máximo stay with system.settings.set. __main__: grounds setting=brightness for both operations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


